{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "ai-agent",
   "label": "AI Agent",
   "zh": "AI 代理",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/ai-agent.html",
   "oneline": "模型 ＋ 可呼叫的工具 ＋ 一個沒人在看的迴圈。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "alignment",
   "label": "Alignment",
   "zh": "對齊",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/alignment.html",
   "oneline": "我們寫得出來的那個分數，跟我們心裡真正想要的結果，中間永遠有一段差距。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark",
   "label": "Benchmark",
   "zh": "評測基準",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/benchmark.html",
   "oneline": "一份標準考卷。它只證明模型擅長那份考卷。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "chain-of-thought",
   "label": "Chain-of-Thought",
   "zh": "思考鏈",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/chain-of-thought.html",
   "oneline": "先在草稿紙上寫過程再回答，正確率會上升。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "next-token-prediction",
   "label": "Next Token Prediction",
   "zh": "猜下一個字",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/next-token-prediction.html",
   "oneline": "模型唯一在做的事：看著已經有的字，猜下一個最可能是什麼，然後把它也算進去，再猜下一個。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "reasoning-model",
   "label": "Reasoning Model",
   "zh": "推理模型",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/reasoning-model.html",
   "oneline": "允許它在難題上多想一會兒，而不是每題都想一樣久。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rlvr",
   "label": "RLVR",
   "zh": "可驗證獎勵強化學習",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/rlvr.html",
   "oneline": "用「答案對不對」當獎勵，而不是用「人喜不喜歡」。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "test-time-compute",
   "label": "Test-time Compute",
   "zh": "推論時運算",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/test-time-compute.html",
   "oneline": "把運算花在回答的當下，而不是只花在訓練。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "token",
   "label": "Token",
   "zh": "詞元",
   "kind": "term",
   "cat": "2026-W33",
   "color": "#94a3b8",
   "pending": false,
   "url": "terms/token.html",
   "oneline": "文字被切成的最小單位，也是計費單位。",
   "deg": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "ep:2026-W33-next-token-prediction",
   "label": "2026-W33",
   "zh": "那個「思考中…」到底在想什麼——AI 其實一直在猜下一個字",
   "kind": "lesson",
   "cat": "課程",
   "color": "#1e293b",
   "url": "lessons/2026-W33-next-token-prediction.html",
   "oneline": "你按過那個會先跑「思考中」再回答的模式，它答得比較準，也比較慢。這一集回答為什麼——順便講清楚模型平常到底在做什麼事，以及那段你看不到的思考，帳單是誰付的。",
   "deg": 0
  }
 ],
